    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/ed24d54b1e7e6590f45bea7f6fd5b615.avif?t=1684842883\" /></div><br><br><strong>Quest 4 Papa : Reloaded</strong> tells the story of Roach, a young girl who was bet as a child by his father, felling in the hands of The Scrappers, outcasts that dismount old droids for a living. Now, she\u2019s all grow-up and looking to kick the ass of the one that dared to bet her, no matter who or what stands in her way.<br><br>Scrap and destroy tons of bots in a screw loose world and make your way to the slums of the city to reach your father and get sweet revenge!!!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/a40fc13b180859695c853dd6bb194d1f.avif?t=1684842883\" /></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A world filled with sci-fi action:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/5971b65c2b8d58ff9ab392212707d3cd.poster.avif?t=1684842883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/5971b65c2b8d58ff9ab392212707d3cd.webm?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/5971b65c2b8d58ff9ab392212707d3cd.mp4?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fast-paced top down shooter gameplay:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/244adb10e5bf06fc6fd877c375581968.poster.avif?t=1684842883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/244adb10e5bf06fc6fd877c375581968.webm?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/244adb10e5bf06fc6fd877c375581968.mp4?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A narative driven experience:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/0c968659425d36745ed21f7b1dd7c1e4.poster.avif?t=1684842883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/0c968659425d36745ed21f7b1dd7c1e4.webm?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/0c968659425d36745ed21f7b1dd7c1e4.mp4?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">A world full of surprises:</h2></strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/4977167cf2f0921fbd72a47721bf1318.poster.avif?t=1684842883\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/4977167cf2f0921fbd72a47721bf1318.webm?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/4977167cf2f0921fbd72a47721bf1318.mp4?t=1684842883\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/a0314dc9cb71f37107ea1d9189626940.avif?t=1684842883\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1323410/extras/f3c3d8745d8b9f5e